This directory is the canonical source for repository agent skills.

The skill definitions under `.agents/skills/` are used by Codex in this
repository, and they are validated by `.agents/validate-skills.pl`.
The skill tree is documented in `pod/perlagentskills.pod`.

The matching `.claude/skills/` tree is a compatibility mirror for Claude
Code. The validator expects the mirror to exist and to stay byte-for-byte in
sync with the canonical copies in `.agents/skills/`.

To refresh the mirror automatically, run:

`./perl -Ilib .agents/validate-skills.pl --sync-claude`

In short:

- Edit `.agents/skills/...` first.
- Keep `.claude/skills/...` in sync.
- Do not assume Claude Code reads `.agents/skills/`.
